{"name":"Squeaky","hex":"#6cc4da","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"squeaky","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Tending to produce a high-pitched sound or squeak."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/squeaky"}],"entries":[{"title":"Squeaky Fromme","blocks":[{"text":"Lynette Alice \"Squeaky\" Fromme is an American former member of the Manson Family, a cult led by Charles Manson. Though not involved in the Tate–LaBianca murders for which the Manson family is best known, she attempted to assassinate U.S. president Gerald Ford in 1975. For that crime, she was sentenced to life in prison. She was paroled from prison on August 14, 2009, after serving approximately 34 years. She published a book about her life in 2018."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Mugshot_of_Lynette_%22Squeaky%22_Fromme.png/330px-Mugshot_of_Lynette_%22Squeaky%22_Fromme.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Squeaky_Fromme","wikidata":"Q508703"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Lynette_%22Squeaky%22_Fromme%27s_High_School_Yearbook_Photo_%281964%29.jpg/500px-Lynette_%22Squeaky%22_Fromme%27s_High_School_Yearbook_Photo_%281964%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Lynette_%22Squeaky%22_Fromme%27s_High_School_Yearbook_Photo_%281964%29.jpg/1280px-Lynette_%22Squeaky%22_Fromme%27s_High_School_Yearbook_Photo_%281964%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Lynette_%22Squeaky%22_Fromme%27s_High_School_Yearbook_Photo_%281964%29.jpg/500px-Lynette_%22Squeaky%22_Fromme%27s_High_School_Yearbook_Photo_%281964%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Fromme's 1964 high schoo